 "<div class=\"card\">\n        <h2>印刷目錄頁 <span class=\"meta\">— OCR 辨識結果，供參考</span></h2>\n        <ul class=\"meta\" style=\"columns:2;column-gap:2rem\">{0}</ul>\n      </div>": "<div class=\"card\">\n        <h2>Printed contents page <span class=\"meta\">— as OCR'd, for reference</span></h2>\n        <ul class=\"meta\" style=\"columns:2;column-gap:2rem\">{0}</ul>\n      </div>",
